WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:04.480
<b>Year 991 of the Holy Era</b>

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:05.780
Rio...

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.820
We haven't evaluated your 
academic abilities yet,

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.320
but I was wondering, can you read and write?

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.360
No. I've never studied writing, so...

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.200
I see. Then, I'll tutor you!

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:22.850
Come to my research lab after school. 
It's in the basement of the library tower.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:24.920
Thank you.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.650
Oh, and...

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:28.780
Yes?

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:32.670
Many of the children here are from 
royal or titled families, so...

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.380
In the beginning, they may be a little...

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.290
It's all right.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.060
What?

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.810
I know my place.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:43.960
I see.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.540
But if you have any problems, please don't
 hesitate to come to me, all right?

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.280
I will.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.910
Welcome to the Beltrum Royal Academy!

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:14.220
Seirei Gensouki

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:14.220
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:29.000
<b>Royal Academy</b>

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:29.000
<b>Royal Academy</b>

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.130
Huh? Who is that?

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:28.500
A transfer student?

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:33.500
A transfer student will be joining this class
 starting today. His name is Rio.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.280
I've never seen him before.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.340
Everyone, be nice to him, all right?

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.600
So, he's the transfer student 
from the slums, huh?

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.150
The slums?

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.970
Someone as lowly as that is joining 
our glorious Royal Academy?

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.580
I heard that he saved Princess Flora,

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.500
so His Majesty, the King, 
approved his enrollment.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:51.270
On this occasion, you have done well in 
saving my daughter. I give you my thanks.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.070
Your words do me too great an honor.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.840
I am both humbled and delighted.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.150
Very good.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:00.350
Then, we shall have you attend the 
Royal Academy's primary school

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:02.370
as a scholarship student.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.100
Rio?

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.610
Introduce yourself to everyone.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:08.310
Yes, miss.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:09.910
My name is Rio.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.920
Through the kindness bestowed 
upon me by His Majesty, the King,

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.860
I have been allowed to attend 
this place of learning.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.660
I know that I am lacking in many ways,

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.370
but I hope that you will 
look favorably upon me.

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:22.130
Very nice.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.300
It seems he can speak as 
well as a servant, at least.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.550
Well then, Rio, if you'll 
take a seat there, please.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:31.200
Yes, miss.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.220
All right, everyone, we're starting our lesson.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.010
Let's all study hard again today.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:45.160
Yes, miss.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.730
Open up your notebooks and copy 
down this numerical formula.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:56.620
Now then, everyone try solving 
these problems on your own.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:57.910
Yes, miss.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.660
These are so easy.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:06.790
Rio?

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.990
You don't need to push yourself 
too hard today, all right?

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:12.810
Yes, miss. Thank you for your concern.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:16.770
I don't think he can read.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.960
All right, everyone. Focus on your work.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.690
Where is it?!

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:33.250
There was a hint hidden in that paper!
 Where has it gone?!

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:31.140
Is this it?

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:33.250
Professor Celia?

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.330
Oh, honestly!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.260
Can't you read the sign?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.880
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.370
I can't read.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.020
Rio?

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.530
I came to inquire about my 
private tutoring, but...

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:51.640
Yes! Well done in coming here. 
I've been waiting for you. Yes!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.790
<i>She completely forgot, didn't she?</i>

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.630
W-Well then, come in.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.610
Yes, miss.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:04:59.900
Please, excuse my intrusion—

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:05.970
I-It's just a tiny bit messy at the moment.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:06.860
I see.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.990
U-Usually, I'm much more organized.

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:14.390
Just a moment. I'll make us some space.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:17.120
There are a lot of 
difficult-looking books here.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.210
But you look so young, Professor.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.310
Hm? Oh, yes.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.530
I'm still only twelve, after all.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:24.490
What?

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.560
Really, I should be attending 
primary school,

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.760
but I skipped grades and ended up 
graduating from high school.

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.600
You must be quite brilliant.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.490
W-Well, I suppose.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.900
I've finished.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.330
A-Already?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.820
What? This is amazing! 
All your answers are correct!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.450
And you did it so quickly with 
only mental calculations...

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.280
Well, it was only simple 
multiplication and division.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.150
Once I understood how to write 
the numbers and symbols...

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.270
Simple?

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:57.830
Pretty much the only one in your class 
who can do this is Princess Christina.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.330
What? I-I see.

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.130
<i>Well, that makes sense.</i>

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:05.760
<i>I...</i>

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:08.300
<i>was a university student, after all.</i>

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.280
Rio...

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.300
Where did you learn arithmetic?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.380
From my mother, who died.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:16.530
I see.

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:19.270
Your mother was quite cultured.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.270
Yes.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:23.490
She was a kind and warm person.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.420
I'm sorry for making you think of her.

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.400
Don't be. I'm fine.

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:31.860
That's a relief. I'll make 
us some tea, all right?

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.080
Here you are. Please, have some.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:43.010
Thank you.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.590
It's very good.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.640
I'm glad you like it! 
When you drink a good cup of tea...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.620
It just makes you feel happy, doesn't it?

00:06:57.570 --> 00:06:58.550
Rio?

00:06:58.550 --> 00:06:59.230
Yes?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:02.530
How was your first day of academy life?

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.650
Please, tell me. Did you have any problems?

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.190
No.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.070
Nothing in particular.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:13.260
I see. Well, if there is anything—

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.750
In that case, just one thing.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:16.740
What is it?

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:20.210
Will you recommend me some children's books?

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.920
Books?

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:23.990
I want to learn my letters.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.380
Oh... Yes.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.430
I'll pick out a few for you from the library.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.110
Thank you.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:33.470
One, two, three, four, five!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.430
One! Two! Three!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:38.560
One, two, three, four, five!

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.560
Four! Five!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:39.560
Stay agile!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:43.330
One, two, three, four, five!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:43.610
Rio.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:44.560
Y-Yes, Sir?

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:49.320
One, two, three, four, five!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.260
Come and strike me in any way you see fit.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.070
What?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.320
Yes, sir.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.640
Interesting.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.490
What? Huh?

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.280
What?

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.230
What kind of stance is that?

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:58.160
That stance is weird.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.750
Now, attack.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.620
<i>Now, Haruto!</i>

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.290
Don't hold back. Attack!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.010
Don't hesitate!

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.880
Good swordsmanship.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:18.510
Advance!

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:23.660
Haruto!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:24.940
Don't dodge it!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.370
Drive toward your opponent's chest!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:38.710
Instead of evading to the outside, 
he drove toward his opponent.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:40.830
His form isn't right at all.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.050
It seems there's no end to his vulgarity.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.330
All right. That's enough.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:52.160
Rio, you have the makings 
of a knight, indeed.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.550
I'm terribly sorry,

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:55.930
but I have no interest in joining the knights.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:56.830
Really...

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:59.180
I thank you for your kind words.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.260
What?

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.470
What did he just say?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:02.220
That's crazy.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:06.600
Rio?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.230
Yes?

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.240
You're even studious after classes end.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:11.940
End-of-term exams are coming up soon.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:16.580
You've only just enrolled here. You don't 
need to worry about your grades too much.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.490
I won't.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.990
But I'll give it everything I have.

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.340
Very good.

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:26.770
Does everyone have an examination paper?

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:28.180
Yes, miss.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.380
Then, begin!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.000
Yikes! Um...

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:32.690
One, two, three...

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:35.110
Mouths closed, everyone!

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:43.130
Everyone, do your best!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:57.150
<i>Mii...</i>

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:58.360
...chan.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.850
There he is.

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:01.660
Is that him?

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.420
Really?

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:04.440
A kid from the slums enrolled here.

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.650
His Majesty, the King, is pretty eccentric.

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:10.700
Ayase Miharu was...

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:14.240
Amakawa Haruto's childhood friend.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:19.920
<i>But when Haruto's parents divorced, 
the two of them were separated.</i>

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:24.330
<i>Then I saw Mii-chan again in high school...</i>

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:25.870
<i>and that was it.</i>

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.250
<i>She never came back to school.</i>

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:32.650
<i>It was as though she'd erased 
herself from my sight.</i>

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:36.650
And what of it?

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.150
Amakawa Haruto is dead.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:40.920
Right now, I am Rio.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.090
I'm not Amakawa Haruto anymore.

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:44.970
That's why...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.940
I will live through this.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.970
I will be tenacious and strong.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:50.890
This can't be right!

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:51.800
It can't be.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:52.630
That guy?

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:53.880
Really?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.380
Alongside Princess Christina?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.400
That's impossible!

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:57.850
I'm third?

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:01.130
You've got to be kidding me! 
This must be some kind of mistake!

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.590
That's right!

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.180
Hey, he's here.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.570
You! What impropriety have you perpetrated?

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.390
What do you mean?

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:09.390
That!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.850
A commoner like you

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:14.220
could never stand with Princess Christina 
at the top of the class!

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:15.650
Anything other than fraud is unthinkable!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.530
Top of the class?

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:19.400
You must have used some kind of dirty trick!

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:22.200
I simply took the exam, that's all.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.100
Liar!

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:24.520
Leave it, Alphonse.

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:28.870
The jealousy of a gentleman is unsightly.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.450
I-I can't let this pass unchallenged! 
I will have this injustice—

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.690
Do you have any concrete evidence?

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.500
That's...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.350
Unsubstantiated allegations only serve to
 sully the dignity of the academy.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:42.090
But...

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:45.220
This achievement is the result 
of Rio's hard work.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.410
I can attest to that.

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.350
Professor Celia...

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.260
I will never accept this!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.790
Let's go.

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:54.860
Yeah.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.200
Thank you for—

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:00.270
It was nothing. And I didn't 
intervene for your sake.

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:01.300
I see.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.600
You won't beat me next time.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:07.550
Rio!

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.820
Congratulations on placing 
first in the end-of-term exams!

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:11.130
Thank you.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.760
To tell you the truth...

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:15.230
I'm a little worried.

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:16.090
Worried?

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:16.630
Yes.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:21.630
When I think that even more students may 
look for ways to find fault with you...

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.880
I'm used to it already.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:24.630
Oh, dear.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.850
This bullying by nobles shows poor 
character on their part, you know.

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:33.140
Professor Celia, you said that you excelled. 
Did anything similar happen to you?

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:38.730
Well, this and that from those of a higher 
social standing and their followers.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.230
I ignored all of it, though.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.420
Just as I thought.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:44.270
I-In my case, I had friends!

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:46.420
Then, I'll be fine, too.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.450
What?

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.610
I have you, Professor Celia.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:50.680
Huh?

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:52.040
What?

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.580
Oh, Rio!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.080
Yes?

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:58.720
You're making fun of me, aren't you?
 Treating me like a child!

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:01.350
But you're older than me, Professor.

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:09.190
Y-Yes, but... well... it means you 
think of me as a friend, right?

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:09.950
Yes.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.260
Would you rather I didn't?

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:14.150
I... don't mind.

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:14.560
What?

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:17.560
I... don't mind.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.550
Will you say it just one more time, please?

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:21.570
I...

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.820
I said I don't mind! You're so mean, Rio!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.120
Figure it out from the mood,
 can't you? Honestly!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.090
Then...

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:35.080
If ever I'm in trouble, advise me as 
my teacher and as my friend, won't you?

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.580
O-Of course!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:42.950
When you're about to cry from all 
the bullying, I'll take you to my bosom.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:47.470
You're small, so in terms of positioning, 
you do seem perfect for clinging to.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:51.860
Don't say "small"! I'm still growing!

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:53.740
Oh, we're the perfect heights.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.030
Yes.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.460
Oh, Rio, you silly!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:06.950
<b>Year 996 of the Holy Era</b>

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:06.950
An exhibition tournament between the knights
 of the realm will be held again this year.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:11.560
Representatives for the primary school 
division have been selected from this class.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:13.950
If your name is called, step forward!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.830
Sixth-year, Alphonse Rodan!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:17.890
Sir!

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:20.300
Fifth-year, Stewart Huguenot.

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:20.920
Sir!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:23.640
And...

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:24.850
Rio!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.840
What? It can't be true.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:26.780
Step forward!

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:27.840
Sir.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.840
Him? Why?

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:30.990
Wait!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.080
What is it?

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.560
I cannot accept this.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:38.130
For someone so lowly to have been chosen to 
participate in a knightly tournament...

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.450
That's right!

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:39.840
It is a disgrace!

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:43.030
Besides, he can't even use magic.

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:45.730
It has already been decided.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.450
No objections will be entertained.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:48.400
But how?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.160
I just can't accept it.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.580
I heard you'll be participating 
in the tournament.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.470
Yes, well...

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:01.300
If you do well in the tournament,

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:05.560
the knights may scout you even 
before you graduate, you... know.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:09.520
I have no intention of becoming a knight.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.510
Rio...

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.300
Yes?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.160
You've gotten taller, haven't you?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:14.780
What?

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:18.150
Well, I suppose it has 
been five years already.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:20.860
Professor...

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:21.850
What is it?

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:24.100
You're still just as small 
as ever, aren't you?

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:27.200
Don't say "small"! 
I'm still growing, I tell you!

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:28.970
You said the same thing five years ago.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:30.380
Hmph!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.860
The tea will get cold.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:32.860
Oh...

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:36.720
Such a lovely aroma!

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:39.960
It's so good!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.290
They're the same leaves,

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.790
but when you make the tea, Rio, 
the scent is completely different!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:47.420
I simply follow the instructions
 I read in a book.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:51.330
You say you have no intention 
of becoming a knight.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:53.050
What will you do after you graduate?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.650
I thought I'd go on a journey.

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:55.620
What?

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.400
There's somewhere I'd like to go.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.620
Then... you plan to leave this country?

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:01.870
This country...

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:04.690
is difficult for me to live in.

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.280
That may be so, but...

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.530
Why don't you work here?

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.110
What?

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.800
Without you around, 
all sorts of things will go wrong.

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:16.120
That's not true.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.310
You see? The way you tidied here...
 It's so clean!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:21.330
And you make such wonderful tea!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:25.630
You always chide me when I get too 
caught up in my research. And...

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.590
I'm grateful for your consideration, but...

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:31.250
Professor, sooner or later you'll 
enter into marriage talks, won't you?

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.860
What's this all of a sudden?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:36.880
It wouldn't be good to have some 
unknown commoner in your research lab.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.890
I've no intention of getting 
married for a long time, though.

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:44.020
Well, I'm sure you're free 
to do as you like, Professor.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:47.260
Hey! You're thinking I'm going to miss 
my chance to get married, aren't you?

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:51.940
Professor Celia, you look so youthful 
and lovely, I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:55.840
So you're saying I look like a child.

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:59.580
Not at all. You're a charming woman.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.330
D-Don't tease me like that.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.060
What was that?

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:07.580
Oh! Um, well... Where is it 
that you want to go, Rio?

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.540
My parents' homeland, the Yagumo region.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:15.090
Yagumo? The place at the 
edge of the wilderness?

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:17.670
Yes.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:24.680
When you're bigger, I'll take you there.
 It's a place called Yagumo.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:27.190
Really? You promised, okay?

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:28.970
Rio?

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.530
I-It's only a plan at the moment.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:34.740
<i>Rio...</i>

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.850
Now, the tournament between the 
glorious knights of the realm

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.790
and the students of the 
Royal Academy will begin!

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:51.170
And I, Alfred Emerle, unworthy as 
I am, will serve as referee today!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.420
As noble as ever!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.420
Emerle-sama!

00:17:56.060 --> 00:18:00.430
Beltrum Royal Academy primary school! 
First challenger, Rio! Stand forward!

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:07.810
Hey! Don't put on a pathetic 
performance out there.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.260
You'll lower people's opinions of me as well.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:13.320
I will do my best not to 
fight an unsightly match.

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:16.440
No one is expecting anything from you anyway.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.740
Rio!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.490
Keep it together!

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:24.850
I am ready to begin.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:25.750
Good.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.500
And from the Knights of the Royal Guard,

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.500
the first challenger,

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.720
Charles Arbor!

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:37.810
I knew you'd enrolled in the academy,

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:40.380
but I'd never have imagined that the 
dirty little brat from back then

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.800
would be my opponent.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.430
I owe you a debt for your care of me back then.

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:50.000
I was so very sorry I couldn't 
have been of more help.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.610
Cease your chatter.

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.100
Challengers at the ready!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.830
<i>What is that stance?</i>

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:03.000
<i>He doesn't have a shield. Is he mocking me?</i>

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:04.910
Begin!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.080
Rio's amazing!

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:13.590
He's staying calm and parrying the blows.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:18.880
<i>Because of you, I was punished 
with a demotion five years ago!</i>

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:21.470
<i>I will never forget that humiliation!</i>

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.220
H-Hold on!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:26.140
How could a knight fight so 
seriously against a student?!

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.340
Now, Rio!

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:29.930
What?

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:32.020
This will finish you!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.200
Hold!

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:43.270
The winner, representing the academy, is Rio!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:44.990
W-Wait, please!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:47.180
I let down my guard. That's all!

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.050
What?

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:49.820
I'll fight for real next—

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.080
Idiot!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.580
A loss is a loss!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.730
Alfred...

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:55.940
Charles.

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:58.300
If you are a member of the honorable 
Knights of the Royal Guard,

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.310
you will graciously accept your 
defeat and take your leave.

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:06.470
I-I admit my defeat.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.550
Thank you for the match.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.230
Very good.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:12.030
Amazing! Amazing!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.110
Indeed.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.240
<i>Rio, was it?</i>

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.490
<i>I look forward to his future.</i>

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:30.790
Blast that annoying brat!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:34.370
If I'd been serious, I would have won!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:39.300
In that sort of situation, it isn't so 
bad to let the students take the glory.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.130
With no understanding
 of such consideration,

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:45.210
in the end, the other Knights 
of the Royal Guard all won.

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:47.140
Dear, dear. How childish of them.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.410
Th-That's right!

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.520
I let him take the glory!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.820
Just as you'd expect from the Honorable 
Ambassador of the Proxia Empire.

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:54.170
You understand!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.450
And that student who fought against you...

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:00.160
Huh?

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.570
He certainly moved very well.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.720
That brat!

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:06.610
Five years ago,

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:10.370
it was thought he might have been 
involved in Princess Flora's kidnapping.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:14.870
At the time, I investigated vigorously, but...

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.170
In the end, he never talked.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:17.880
I see!

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:20.710
So you two were fated 
to face each other, then.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.360
I don't know about fated.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.350
<i>I see. From back then...</i>

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:36.230
I hope he comes soon. I need 
to celebrate his win with him!

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:37.480
Rio!

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:43.110
I wonder where he's going.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.300
H-Here. Please, read it!

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.460
What is it?

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:53.480
Y-Yesterday's match! 
You were so... so very dashing!

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:56.660
So gallant!

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:57.900
Oh! Excuse me!

00:21:58.640 --> 00:21:59.980
Wait, you there!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Time

